    "title": "Express feasibility with V得了 / V不了",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-complements-p02-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express feasibility with V得了 / V不了",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "V得了/V不了 expresses feasibility, with 了 pronounced liǎo. Distinguish this potential pattern from event 了 and manner 得.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我吃得了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ chī de liǎo 。",
                "meaning": "I can manage to eat it.",
                "audio": "09b5b6edea898858a532eb94645379ae8197818d45a0e04913bc0c0edc9351c8"
              },
              {
                "text": "这么多，我吃不了。",
                "pinyin": "zhème duō ， wǒ chī bù liǎo 。",
                "meaning": "There is so much that I cannot manage to eat it.",
                "audio": "942582cf57687a9e0de8d8f1117391d0e5bb5880cb65e4aad03446f1fb392661"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
